{"unit_id":"tag:07A1:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。若\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> 对 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005> 成立，并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对集合（sets）的层（sheaves）之间的每个满射（surjection）<MATH_0006>，增广的（extended）<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 复形（complex）\n<MATH_0007> 正合（exact），\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则 <MATH_0008> 是全无上同调的（totally acyclic）（逆命题（converse）也成立）。\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"extended","target_term":"增广的"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调的"},{"source_term":"converse","target_term":"逆命题"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"覆盖层取值"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"覆盖层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"覆盖映射"},{"source_term":"extended","target_term":"增广的","context":"扩充 Čech 复形"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"Čech 复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"复形正合性"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调的","context":"全无上同调性判据"},{"source_term":"converse","target_term":"逆命题","context":"判据的反方向"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0731:proof","translation":"第 (2) 项是全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）的定义。第 (1) 项是 (2) 的推论，如全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaves）定义后的讨论所指出。第 (3) 项是 (2) 的特殊情形，其中 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 的终对象（final object）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为证明 (4)，由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001>，可以假设 <MATH_0003> 由位点（sites）的态射（morphism）给出。此时可知 <MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005> 对全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）为零，这是由引理 <REF_0002> 中对于高阶直接像（direct images）的描述得到的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"direct images","target_term":"直接像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调","context":"层的全无上同调性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"定义中的层"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"全局截面对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"态射表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"推前态射"},{"source_term":"direct images","target_term":"直接像","context":"高阶直接像描述"}],"notes":[]}
